 389:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer_2.c **** *   Note Some interrupt sources are clear-on-read and require the block 
 390:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer_2.c **** *   interrupt/status register to be read/cleared with the appropriate block API 
 391:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer_2.c **** *   (GPIO, UART, and so on). Otherwise the ISR will continue to remain in 
 392:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer_2.c **** *   pending state even though the interrupt itself is cleared using this API.
